otraitants, incombant audit mandataire en vertu de l'article R. 2142-24 dudit code.\nPour le lot n°1, par application des dispositions de l'article L. 2193-3 (alinéa 2) dudit code, l'acheteur exige en sus que les tâches essentielles suivantes soient effectuées par le titulaire (ou, en cas de cotraitance, par les membres du groupement) et ne fassent, en aucun cas, l'objet de sous-traitance : prestations de désamiantage."},{"field_id":"BT-36-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":4.0},{"field_id":"BT-536-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2027-03-01"},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-63-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"DAY","value":120.0},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"FRA","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Référé précontractuel jusqu'à la signature du marché et référé contractuel dans le délai de 31 jours à compter de la publication de l'avis d'attribution."},{"code":"performance","field_id":"OPT-060-Lot","list":"conditions","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_re